      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:psephrem.letter.budge:1-9",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲥⲁϥ ⲡⲣⲉϥϫⲓⲟⲩⲁ ⲡⲉ · ⲡϩⲟⲟⲩ ⲇⲉ ⲡ**ⲣⲉϥⲥⲱⲧⲙ** ⲡⲉ ·",
      "english": "Yesterday it was the blasphemer, to-day it is the man of obedience.",
